- 'POs created before 2015' / 'purchase orders created since March 2024' -> target_entity 'PurchaseOrder' with a 'created_before' or 'created_since' filter whose value is an ISO date 'YYYY-MM-DD'. A date bound satisfies the PurchaseOrder root requirement, so no PO id is needed. Use ONLY when the question names an ABSOLUTE date or year. If it says something RELATIVE — 'older than 6 months', 'stale', 'in the last year' — do NOT compute the date yourself and do NOT set these filters; relative PO date windows are not supported yet, so set unanswerable.
